<title>FRANCE: BNP has 7.2 pct of Suez voting rights.</title>
<headline>BNP has 7.2 pct of Suez voting rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) holds 7.19 percent of the voting rights in Cie de Suez after the automatic doubling of voting rights held for two years, the Conseil des Marches Financiers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that BNP's voting rights had risen to 13,541,942 voting rights in Suez out of a total of 188,157,369, breaching the five percent threshhold.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
